# Paint (UIF-610)
ok text drawn in the font colour
ok nothing above the label
ok transparent: background of the parent
ok opaque: filled with Color
ok outside unchanged
ok right-justified: left half empty
ok right-justified: text in the right half
ok centred: left quarter empty
ok centred: right quarter empty
ok tlBottom: upper half empty
ok tlBottom: text at the bottom
ok tlCenter: top empty
ok tlCenter: bottom empty
ok no WordWrap: one line
ok WordWrap: second line
ok ShowAccelChar False: the ampersand is drawn
ok disabled: no text in the font colour
ok disabled: clGrayText
# accelerator (UIF-611, UIF-612)
ok no FocusControl: not consumed
ok other character: not consumed
ok ShowAccelChar False: not consumed
ok disabled: not consumed
ok focus unchanged so far
ok accelerator consumed
ok FocusControl focused
ok Alt+N through the form focuses FocusControl
ok freed FocusControl cleared
